  m_Name: Step_04_DNSConfig
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScreenshotStepData
  stepId: Step_04_DNSConfig
  instructionText: "The Preferred DNS server points at 127.0.0.1 \u2014 the server's
    own loopback.\n\nThat looks circular and isn't. This machine is about to become
    the DNS server for the whole domain, so the name it needs to resolve first is
    its own. Point it at a router or a public resolver instead and domain join will
    fail on the client with an error that names neither DNS nor the cause.\n\nTap
    NEXT to continue."
  screenshotImage: {fileID: 0}
